Month = {AUG 17},
Abstract = {Discovering chemicals with desired attributes is a long and painstaking
   process. Curated datasets containing reliable quantum-mechanical
   properties for millions of molecules are becoming increasingly
   available. The development of novel machine learning tools to obtain
   chemical knowledge from these datasets has the potential to
   revolutionize the process of chemical discovery. Here, I comment on
   recent breakthroughs in this emerging field and discuss the challenges
   for the years to come.},
